          ],
          "character": "3C",
          "text": "CORRECTO: Samu no vuelve a entrar desde la derecha y la pose cambia a happy mediante un fundido."
        },
        {
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "showCharacter",
              "character": "samu",
              "position": "left",
              "pose": "thinking",
              "enter": "fade"
            }
          ],
          "character": "3C",
          "text": "Segunda comprobación con showCharacter: thinking debe fundirse desde happy porque fade es true por defecto."
        },
        {
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "showCharacter",
              "character": "samu",
              "position": "left",
              "pose": "worried",
              "fade": false
            }
          ],
          "character": "3C",
          "text": "Con showCharacter y fade false, worried debe sustituir a thinking de inmediato y sin volver a entrar."
        },
        {
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "setPose",
              "character": "samu",
              "position": "left",
              "pose": "surprised"
            }
          ],
          "character": "3C",
          "text": "Prueba de setPose: surprised debe aparecer mediante fade porque no hemos desactivado la opción."
        },
        {
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "setPose",
              "character": "samu",
              "position": "left",
              "pose": "neutral",
              "fade": false
            }
          ],
          "character": "3C",
          "text": "CORRECTO: setPose con fade false recupera neutral de inmediato."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Prueba 2: límite de escena y ocultación",
      "lines": [
        {
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "setBackground",
              "value": "assets/images/backgrounds/chapter0/habitacion_neon.webp",
              "cut": true
            },
            {
              "type": "showCharacter",
              "character": "samu",
              "position": "left",
              "pose": "surprised",
              "enter": "left"
